{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Do not close the timeline for suspended executions**\n\n`ON_CHANGE` also emits for PENDING/RETRYING, so these RUNNING records receive an `endTime` and completed duration. Consumers can interpret an active workflow as ended. Supply an end time only for terminal statuses and test that suspended records omit both timeline fields.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sv5Hk","finding_digest":"9d41940da5f7ab624cd6a9018d2ba35a89194805d1b7819b0890cec7e537feb8","finding_id":"arf_v1_tvazidnf66vwetgwveay2k5dlk","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationend::nonterminal-end-time-omission","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationend::nonterminal-end-time-omission","line":192,"observation_digest":"ddaf83a160e5be0f2f9c414a0a8b08e461921d08c472ab2c0c9e185093aa9523","observation_id":"aro_v1_3wxyhila4w7a6l44iffavcyi4r","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_tvazidnf66vwetgwveay2k5dlk","published_at":"2026-09-09T18:57:15Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gaza4v2hy7owxqmfaj7d3xtx4q","reviewed_base_sha":"686c447b61d148228285e1d3e9c07d0b3b0358b1","reviewed_head_sha":"661ff218518770f142c359f81bc08e3d93bc5a7d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":192,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_arrwduraezpxn45ehtovwajrws"},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_cb34xagyc7rbsdmwz76h6b6hl3","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T18:57:15Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
